The generated models (src/oscal_bindings/v1/models.py) are derived from the
OSCAL JSON Schema developed by the National Institute of Standards and
Technology (NIST), https://github.com/usnistgov/OSCAL.
datamodel-code-generator and scripts/postprocess_models.py generate the models
from that schema. The build obtains the schema from the pinned spec artifact of
cairn-proofs/oscal-bindings-specs.

